      "writtenOn": "2022-07-13T03:09:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there ever a time we would want this option to be off?\nCan we just assume that we want the right ID?\nMaybe we can just check PLATFORM_EC_USB_PD_TCPM_PS8745 and if this is set\nassume we need to disambiguate.",
      "revId": "29ef58260a7b1d49c4a491a5981701c76381a97f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7405b004_b5f6c985",
        "filename": "zephyr/Kconfig.tcpm",
