      "writtenOn": "2022-07-13T03:23:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm OK are you actually seeing different f/w versions that give different results?\nHow would we know when to disable this option? I imagine older chips had some issues, but we don\u0027t want to generate new Kconfig options just for the sake of it.",
      "parentUuid": "7405b004_b5f6c985",
      "revId": "29ef58260a7b1d49c4a491a5981701c76381a97f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "823ffad0_c1f57300",
