      },
      "lineNbr": 177,
      "author": {
        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-07-13T03:50:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes; version 0x20 (which is on every device that hasn\u0027t yet been updated, AFAIK) says it\u0027s a PS8815-A2, whereas version 0x02 says it\u0027s a PS8745 with device ID 3 (which is less wrong, but still wrong). Future versions will probably have correct IDs.",
      "parentUuid": "05536b32_d417aed3",
      "revId": "29ef58260a7b1d49c4a491a5981701c76381a97f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
